flowchart LR
    Q[Query] --> QT[Query Transformer<br/>HyDE / expansion]
    QT --> SI[Semantic Index<br/>embeddings + ANN]
    QT --> LI[BM25 Index<br/>lexical search]

    SI --> SF[Score Fusion<br/>Reciprocal Rank<br/>Fusion]
    LI --> SF

    SF --> MF[Metadata<br/>Filter]
    MF --> RR[Re-ranker<br/>cross-encoder]
    RR --> MMR[MMR Diversity<br/>Filter]
    MMR --> TK[Top-K<br/>Results]
    TK --> CTX[Agent<br/>Context]

